 4
Display the employees who earn less than the least salary of
DEPTNO 10. (Use ALL Operator)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> SELECT EMPNO, ENAME, SAL
     FROM EMP
     WHERE SAL < ALL
     (
         SELECT SAL
         FROM EMP
         WHERE DEPTNO = 10
     );

